#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:352
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Zadani kod zemlje koristi se za formatiranje brojeva koji ne uključuju "
"međunarodni prefiks (npr. +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ako je polje prazno, sustav ga pokušava automatski otkriti s vaše SIM "
"kartice ili mreže.\n"
"\n"
"Ovdje ga možete ručno nadjačati unosom 2-slovnog ISO koda regije (npr. US, "
"FI, DE) ili pozivnog koda (npr. +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:373
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Ton povratnog zvona je zvuk koji se reproducira (tu-tu-tu-tu) dok se čeka "
"odgovor na odlazni poziv. Neki ga operateri ne generiraju pa ga ovdje imamo "
"opciju ručno generirati. \n"
"\n"
"Možete odabrati vlastitu glazbenu datoteku ili je izbrisati da biste "
"koristili standardni ton sustava."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:393
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Odaberite Ringback Tone"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:401
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Audio datoteke"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:427
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite adresare za korištenje s telefonijom i poredajte ih po prioritetu. "
"Najviši adresar ima najveći prioritet i imat će prednost ako se broj nalazi "
"u više adresara. Možete upotrijebiti prekidač za rješavanje duplikata u "
"nastavku za pomoć pri upravljanju duplikatima, ali čak i ako je onemogućen, "
"preporučujemo da ga omogućite radi boljeg iskustva."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:446
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, ako vas isti telefonski broj nazove 3 puta unutar 5 "
"minuta, treći poziv (i naredni unutar prozora) prisilit će telefon da zvoni "
"najvećom glasnoćom, zaobilazeći način rada Tiho ili Ne uznemiravaj."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:458
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite kontakte koji će uvijek reproducirati obavijesti punom glasnoćom, "
"čak i kada je telefon u načinu Tiho ili Ne uznemiravaj."

